      "short_description": "Deploy SAP HANA with SAP S/4HANA or SAP BW/4HANA on IBM Cloud Virtual Private Cloud (VPC).",
      "long_description": "This automation solution deploys an SAP landscape consisting of SAP HANA DB and SAP NetWeaver running SAP S/4HANA or SAP BW/4HANA on IBM Cloud Virtual Private Cloud (VPC).\n\nThe solution creates a VPC landing zone, a SAP HANA database virtual server instance, and a SAP application virtual server instance hosting SAP NetWeaver PAS and ASCS. It configures DNS, NTP, NFS storage, and downloads SAP installation media from an existing IBM Cloud Object Storage bucket.\n\nSupported SAP solutions are S/4HANA 2023, S/4HANA 2022, S/4HANA 2021, S/4HANA 2020, and BW/4HANA 2021.\n\nPrerequisites:\n\nAn existing IBM Cloud Object Storage bucket must contain the required SAP HANA and SAP solution installation media. IBM Cloud Object Storage service credentials, an RSA SSH key pair, and an external IP address or CIDR range for SSH access are required.\n\nNote:\n\nThe default deployment is in a single VPC zone and does not provide native high availability or disaster recovery.",
      "offering_docs_url": "https://github.com/terraform-ibm-modules/terraform-ibm-vpc-sap/tree/main/solutions/ibm-catalog/sap-s4hana-bw4hana",
      "offering_icon_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IBM-Cloud/sap-netweaver-abap-hana/main/SAP_GlobalPartner.png",
      "features": [
        {
          "title": "SAP S/4HANA and SAP BW/4HANA",
          "description": "Deploys SAP S/4HANA or SAP BW/4HANA with SAP HANA on IBM Cloud VPC."
        },
        {
          "title": "VPC landing zone",
          "description": "Creates the IBM Cloud VPC infrastructure, including management, network services, storage, and optional monitoring and VPN services."
        },
        {
          "title": "SAP HANA and application servers",
          "description": "Creates and configures dedicated SAP HANA database and SAP NetWeaver application virtual server instances."
        },
        {
          "title": "Automated SAP installation",
          "description": "Downloads SAP media from IBM Cloud Object Storage and automates SAP HANA and SAP software installation."
        },
        {
          "title": "High availability notice",
          "description": "The default deployment is single-zone and does not provide native high availability or disaster recovery."
        }
      ],
